	(text "R1/R2 = 10k/1.5k, ratio 1.5/11.5 = 0.1304.\nTap = 1.57 V at 12 V nominal, and reaches 3.3 V (VDDA)\nonly at a 25.3 V rail, so the ADC input stays below VDDA\nfor any plausible transient on the ESC 12 V rail.\nD3 clamps negative excursions: DS11853 Table 60 allows\nzero negative current injection on PC0..PC3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.6 126 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "38dbbbd4-fa8c-455a-9ea3-827fba663572")
	)
