    (property "Notes" "Schottky clamp on the VBAT sense tap. Hongjiacheng BAT54W SOD-123 (C7502705, Preferred-Extended), chosen 2026-08-15: IR 2 uA max at 25 V. Picked over the only Basic Schottky B5819W, whose 0.5-1 mA leakage is 250-500x too much for an ADC divider node." (at 81.28 151.13 0)
